# Apply before synth_xilinx's map_dsp stage in each synthesis process.
# Yosys 0.66 DSP register packing loses the sign extension of the generated
# embedding multiplier. Keep DSP multiplication, but not register/adder packing.
# See tests/test_xilinx_signed_embedding_product.py and the accompanying README.
scratchpad -set xilinx_dsp.multonly 1
